Changing the annotation to `@InterfaceAudience.LimitedPrivate({"HBase"})` allows restricted access for HBase while broadening the audience, thus resolving the incompatibility. Furthermore, simplifying the output statement to only print `PLATFORM_NAME` ensures consistency with the new intended usage and avoids potential confusion from extraneous information.

